  "description": "ASP.NET Web Forms server control that provides a rich-text editor with automatic Microsoft Word paste cleanup and an optional formatting toolbar. Wraps the word-paste-editor client library to sanitize pasted Word HTML while preserving meaningful formatting (tables, fonts, colors, lists, images).",
