  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0: Optional formatting toolbar (Toolbar=\"true\"): bold, italic, underline, text and highlight colour, alignment, links, clear formatting. Word auto-numbering now pastes as the literal numbers Word showed, including serial-number columns in tables (these used to paste as bullets). Public EditorClientID property. Fixed: an edit made just before an UpdatePanel async postback could be lost; Chrome added font-family: inherit spans when aligning text. Client library word-paste-editor 1.1.0.",
